# Selfless Police Captain: "put its +1/+1 counters on target creature you control" - only that kind (CR 122.1, 603.10a), unlike a
# "put its counters" ability. The Captain attacks on turn 3 and a sacrificed Cryogen Relic puts a stun counter on the tapped
# creature. Bot2's Lightning Bolt then kills it, and Bot1's Ornithopter, the one creature of Bot1's left, gets the +1/+1 counter
# but not the stun counter.

